'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an [[Operation_Modifiers|Operation Modifier]] in [[Helldivers 2]]. This modifier impacts all operations taken on [[Biomes#City Biomes|Megacity Biomes]] during Defense-campaigns.

During Liberation-campaigns and Eradication and Defense-missions, the modifier is reduced to "SEAF Units In Area" thus only having SEAF Soldiers and no civilians in the mission-map.

== Details ==
* [[SEAF Soldier|SEAF Soldiers]] as well as [[Civilian|Civilians]] will be present throughout the biome through the entirety of the mission.
** If a [[Helldiver]] is directly responsible for the death of either group, this will result in the entire squad depleting 25 {{Currency|Requisition}} per kill from the mission total.
* Civilians are unarmed pedestrians that often appear in moderately sized groups and will typically run past [[Helldiver|Helldivers]] while escaping from [[enemies]] of [[Federation of Super Earth|Super Earth]].
* SEAF Soldiers are often seen in small firegroups of 3-6, where they will be actively fighting or seeking enemy forces of Super Earth.

== Change History ==
{{Change History Head}}
{{Change History Update|1.003.002|changes=
Added to the game
}}
