{{Quote|'''Objective locations''' are hidden.|Operation Modifiers Description}}

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an [[Operation_Modifiers|Operation Modifier]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]'' exclusive to the [[Automatons|Automaton]] front.

== Details ==
*Hides the exact location of Missions Objectives on the map, requiring Helldivers to search within a radius for a Mission Objective.
**Practically all objective-markers are turned into "Elimination"-markers such as seen in [[Eliminate Automaton Hulks]]-mission.
**Topographics on the minimap remain unchanged, enabling sharp-eyed Helldivers to scout and easily spot larger objectives such [[Launch ICBM|ICBM Launch areas]]
** Pinging the objective will display its precise location on the minimap. Such as pinging the tower of the Air Base Control Tower.

