'''Frost Flower''', is a teal colored flower with bio-luminescent elements. It is considered an [[Environmental Hazards|Environmental Hazard]].

== Effect ==
When stepped on by a creature or otherwise damaged, it explodes into a temporary stasis cloud which slows and deals mild damage to [[Helldiver]]s. Other creatures are stunned while in the slowing field.

== Detailed Statistics ==
{{Attack_Data/attack|explosion|Iceplant_Shatter}}

